<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Austerdalsbreen from Tungestølen — Tungestølen–Austerdalsbreen viewpoint return</name><desc>Walk from the Tungestølen visitor information point along the west bank and moraine ridges to the established Slingsby viewpoint over Austerdalsbreen, then return along the same path. Enjoy the glacier and icefall views from the hiking viewpoint; glacier travel and unstable ice-edge terrain are outside this route. Recheck local stream and trail conditions.

